    {
      "id": "20261122T142041Z-1ff31b78#1",
      "line": 68,
      "path": "docs/records/lean-code-store-prototype-findings.md",
      "rule": "R19",
      "severity": "should",
      "text": "The 115 private names each have a component after the module prefix, such as `match_7` or `_sparseCasesOn_41`. Fix: Say that the helper name immediately follows `_private.<module>.0`, with no intervening declaration name."
    },
    {
      "id": "20261122T142041Z-1ff31b78#2",
      "line": 75,
      "path": "docs/records/lean-code-store-prototype-findings.md",
      "rule": "R19",
      "severity": "must",
      "text": "The record attributes all ten `match_on_same_ctor` helpers to `DecidableEq`, but the stored bodies show that the helpers for `Syntax.Expr` and `Syntax.Statement` serve derived `BEq` instances. Fix: Report eight `DecidableEq` helpers and two `BEq` helpers here and in owner question 2."
    },
    {
      "id": "20261122T142041Z-1ff31b78#3",
      "line": 151,
      "path": "docs/records/lean-code-store-prototype-findings.md",
      "rule": "R19",
      "severity": "should",
      "text": "The record lists a name in a tactic quotation as leaving no trace in the text, although the name appears in the quotation and Lean can omit its usage from the build products. Fix: Distinguish what the build products record from what the source search can find."
    },
    {
      "id": "20261122T142041Z-1ff31b78#4",
      "line": 237,
      "path": "docs/records/lean-code-store-prototype-findings.md",
      "rule": "R19",
      "severity": "must",
      "text": "The proposed fold assumes a written parent for the four `SqlSelectRule` helpers, but `initialize registerBuiltinAttribute` is anonymous and its generated `initFn` is itself reported because no unscoped constant shares its range. Fix: State that the scoped `initFn` connects the helpers to the command and leave their final written parent unresolved."
    }
